---
title: "Home"
layout: base.njk
permalink: "home/"
---

<section class="me">
    <h2>Heeee-llo.</h2>
    <p>
      
      <img class="alive eerie" style="float: left" src="/images/snake.png">I am Artur and I go by they/them and er/ihn. I believe that everyone needs digital real estate, and this is mine. It's a laboratory because I keep tinkering with it when I am here, and it's where lots of my thoughts are cultivated. I am an artist and researcher by day and ... by night lol.
    </p>
  <div class="status">
    <h3 title="Status">Status</h3>
    <div id="statuscafe">
      <div id="statuscafe-username"></div>
      <div id="statuscafe-content"></div>
    </div>
    <script
      src="https://status.cafe/current-status.js?name=lyonid"
      defer
    ></script>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feed">
  <h2>Latest Post</h2>
  {% set latest_post = collections.post | last %} {% if latest_post %}
  <a class="post" href="{{ latest_post.url }}">
    <div class="post-info">
  <h3>{{ latest_post.data.date.toLocaleDateString() }} ~ {{ latest_post.data.posttitle }}</h3>
      <p>{{ latest_post.data.excerpt }}</p>
    </div>
  </a>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section id="hoard">
  <h2>Hoard</h2>
  <h3>Game Exploration Kit — <a href="/games/">Full catalogue</a></h3>
  <div class="games-preview" style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:.6rem;">
    {% for p in collections.games | slice(0,6) %}
      <a class="mini-cartridge" href="{{ p.url }}" title="{{ p.data.posttitle }}" style="display:block;width:88px;height:88px;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:#111;box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.35);">
        <img src="{{ p.data.image }}" alt="{{ p.data.posttitle }}" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;image-rendering:pixelated;">
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  